{"id":"50247d2ac6831f8d","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-pcf2-bad-point.md","title":"ZFC Pcf2 Bad Point","display":"df-zfc-pcf2-bad-point — ZFC Pcf2 Bad Point","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-pcf2-bad-point","aliases":["58-df-zfc-pcf2-bad-point"],"display":"df-zfc-pcf2-bad-point — ZFC Pcf2 Bad Point","depends_on":["[[58-df-zfc-pcf2-good-point]]","[[58-df-zfc-pcf2-scale]]","[[58-df-cofinality]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-pcf2-bad-point"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-pcf2-bad-point</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-pcf2-bad-point — ZFC Pcf2 Bad Point"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7dd692dab6c2daa2\" href=\"?note=7dd692dab6c2daa2\" title=\"58-df-zfc-pcf2-good-point\">58-df-zfc-pcf2-good-point</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"255774e81caebda9\" href=\"?note=255774e81caebda9\" title=\"58-df-zfc-pcf2-scale\">58-df-zfc-pcf2-scale</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"58-df-cofinality\">58-df-cofinality</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,J,\\lambda,\\vec f,\\delta\\in V\">\\(A,J,\\lambda,\\vec f,\\delta\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2Scale}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2Scale}_S\\)</span> (scale predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"255774e81caebda9\" href=\"?note=255774e81caebda9\" title=\"58-df-zfc-pcf2-scale\">58-df-zfc-pcf2-scale</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2GoodPoint}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2GoodPoint}_S\\)</span> (predicate from dependency)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2BadPoint}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2BadPoint}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf2\\text{-}bad\\text{-}point} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPcf2BadPoint}_S(A,J,\\vec f,\\delta)\\leftrightarrow \\exists\\lambda\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2Scale}_S(A,J,\\lambda,\\vec f)\\land\\delta\\in\\lambda\\land\\operatorname{cf}(\\delta)&gt;\\omega\\land \\neg\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2GoodPoint}_S(A,J,\\lambda,\\vec f,\\delta)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf2\\text{-}bad\\text{-}point} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPcf2BadPoint}_S(A,J,\\vec f,\\delta)\\leftrightarrow \\exists\\lambda\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2Scale}_S(A,J,\\lambda,\\vec f)\\land\\delta\\in\\lambda\\land\\operatorname{cf}(\\delta)&gt;\\omega\\land \\neg\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2GoodPoint}_S(A,J,\\lambda,\\vec f,\\delta)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A bad point is a genuine uncountable-cofinality index of a scale that fails the established good-point predicate; malformed non-scales no longer satisfy the definition vacuously.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zfc-pcf2-good-point","status":"resolved","id":"7dd692dab6c2daa2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-pcf2-good-point]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-pcf2-scale","status":"resolved","id":"255774e81caebda9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-pcf2-scale]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cofinality","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cofinality]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-pcf2-scale","status":"resolved","id":"255774e81caebda9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2Scale}_S$ (scale predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-pcf2-scale]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"A,J,\\lambda,\\vec f,\\delta\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2Scale}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2GoodPoint}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2BadPoint}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf2\\text{-}bad\\text{-}point} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPcf2BadPoint}_S(A,J,\\vec f,\\delta)\\leftrightarrow \\exists\\lambda\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2Scale}_S(A,J,\\lambda,\\vec f)\\land\\delta\\in\\lambda\\land\\operatorname{cf}(\\delta)>\\omega\\land \\neg\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2GoodPoint}_S(A,J,\\lambda,\\vec f,\\delta)\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1168,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3038","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-pcf2-bad-point.md|58-df-zfc-pcf2-bad-point]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["7dd692dab6c2daa2","255774e81caebda9","315ad00b8744fdfc"]}